l fantasy-game appearance.\n\nsummary:\n\n[reference generation] The target is a 10-second, 16:9 cinematic fantasy-comedy video set entirely inside <Subject 1>. <Subject 2> and <Subject 4> share an affectionate private moment before <Subject 3> unexpectedly discovers them. <Subject 3> delivers the first Chinese line, the shot cuts clearly to <Subject 4> for his reply, and the scene ends with <Subject 4> playfully embracing both women at the same time.\n\nretention_analysis:\n\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - the moonlit wooden corridor, lake, distant palace buildings, translucent curtains, warm lanterns, silver-blue moonlight, and drifting red petals remain consistent throughout the video.\n\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - her facial identity, silver-white hair, red ornaments, white garment, translucent sleeves, and layered black-and-red outfit are retained without redesign.\n\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - her facial identity, pointed ears, pale-blonde hair, blue head ornament, blue-and-white dress, cape sleeves, and accessories are retained without redesign.\n\n<Subject 4> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - his facial identity, black hair, golden eyes, fitted black outfit, gloves, belts, and boots are retained without redesign.\n\ndetailed_description:\n\nThe target video uses a polished high-detail 3D fantasy-game cinematic style in a 16:9 widescreen composition. Lighting combines cool silver-blue moonlight with soft golden lantern light. Use exactly three characters, with no additional people, no character duplication, and no subtitles or visible text.\n\n[Shot 1] A medium two-shot establishes <Subject 1>. Near the carved railing, <Subject 4> stands closely beside <Subject 2>. They face each other at intimate conversational distance. <Subject 2> smiles softly and rests one hand lightly against his forearm while <Subject 4> gently brushes a loose strand of silver-white hair away from her cheek. They lean slightly closer and whisper affectionately without audible dialogue. The camera performs a slow arc shot with small amplitude around the pair. Their hair, translucent sleeves, and the nearby curtains move naturally in the night breeze while warm lantern light and cool moonlight alternate across their faces.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.700, the camera cuts clearly to a medium shot facing the far end of the corridor. <Subject 3> steps out from behind a translucent curtain and suddenly notices the affectionate pair in the background. She stops immediately. Her expression changes from surprise to restrained, slightly awkward amusement. The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed as <Subject 3> (S1), using a calm young female voice with a faintly teasing tone, looks toward them and says: <d>[Chinese] 看来我来的不是时候。</d> After finishing the sentence, she closes her lips and begins to turn away.\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:05.000, the camera cuts sharply to a close-up of <Subject 4>. He turns his head toward <Subject 3>, releases a small confident smile, and raises one hand to stop her from leaving. <Subject 4> (S2), using a relaxed young male voice with a playful and completely sincere delivery, replies: <d>[Chinese] 不，你来的正是时候。</d> He closes his lips after the final word and takes one decisive step toward her.\n\n[Shot 4] At 00:07.100, the camera cuts to a frontal medium-wide shot containing all three characters. <Subject 4> moves between the two women, places his left arm gently around <Subject 2>'s shoulders and his right arm gently around <Subject 3>'s shoulders, drawing both women into a playful side-by-side embrace. <Subject 2> accepts the gesture with an amused smile. <Subject 3> stiffens in surprise, widens her eyes, and looks sideways at him with embarrassed disbelief. The camera slowly pulls out as red petals sweep across the foreground. The final frame holds the humorous three-character composition beneath the glowing lanterns, with all faces clearly visible and identities unchanged.\n\noverall_soundscape:\n\nA gentle night breeze moves through the silk curtains and carries red petals along the wooden corridor. Quiet lake water, soft fabric movement, light footsteps, and subtle clothing rustles accompany the characters’ actions. A small comedic percussion tap follows <Subject 3>'s surprised reaction during the final embrace.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\n\nSparse guqin notes and soft sustained strings play at a slow tempo during the opening. After the man’s reply, light pizzicato strings enter and end with a brief playful flourish as he embraces both women."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "提示词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [370, 390], "pos": [-1981.2587890625, 5316.47802734375], "id": 138, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [315], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "size": [230, 60], "pos": [1990, 5080], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 280, "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 251, "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 122, "type": "VAEDecode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecode"}, "order": 36}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "links": [316], "label": "音频", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}], "size": [230, 60], "pos": [1990, 5200], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 281, "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Lat